      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing a Platform**\n\nOkay, I've decided to move forward using Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the managed model platform. I'll need to make sure the code clearly reflects this choice, incorporating the Vertex AI SDK.\n\n\n**Defining the Structure**\n\nNow, I'm making progress on the Python file's skeleton. I'm focusing on defining `stream_platform_generation.py`. My focus is the streaming generation. I plan to use Vertex AI's `GenerativeModel`. I'm going to include the necessary provider identification so it is explicit the code's target platform is Vertex AI.\n\n\n",
