        "text": "**Defining the Resource Selector**\n\nI'm now focusing on the Python file structure and how to resolve provider-specific resources. Currently, I'm leaning toward explicitly identifying a single external provider within the code, making the initial implementation more streamlined. My goal is to select an external provider to be supported by the file.\n\n\n**Choosing Vertex AI**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Vertex AI. My plan is to create `select_platform_resource.py` and implement code to select a specific model. I'll include the necessary imports and client initialization to identify Vertex AI as the provider within the code.\n\n\n",
